DESCRIPTION:Filmed at Paris' iconic Accor Arena during Katy Perry's sold-out Lifetimes Tour performances in November 2025\, Katy Perry: The Lifetimes Tour – Live From Paris captures one of pop music's most spectacular live productions at its peak. Directed by acclaimed concert filmmaker Paul Dugdale and shot with more than 60 camera angles\, the film delivers an immersive front-row experience that showcases the scale\, energy\, and visual ambition of Perry's global tour.<br/><br/>Featuring a career-spanning setlist packed with chart-topping hits\, dazzling production design\, breathtaking choreography\, and electrifying audience moments\, the film celebrates Katy Perry as a world-class performer at the top of her game. From intimate fan connections to arena-shaking anthems\, every moment is captured with cinematic precision\, placing viewers at the heart of an unforgettable live event.<br/><br/>More than a concert film\, The Lifetimes Tour – Live From Paris is a vibrant celebration of Perry's enduring connection with her fans and the music that has defined a generation. Dynamic\, emotional\, and exhilarating\, it is the ultimate showcase of one of pop's most iconic entertainers in full command of the stage.<br/>
DTEND:20260902T040000Z
